[{"id": 10345421930553, "title": "THE CHENILLE SUN CAP", "handle": "the-chenille-sun-cap", "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span></span><span></span><span>What is Chenille, exactly? Simply put, it\u2019s the fuzzy carpet material around the sun emblem that sits on the front of the cap. How fancy! Give it a good look because you can\u2019t give it a good feel. But that kind of quality is emblematic of our capsule collection with Tremont Sporting Co. The Chenille Cap is extremely breathable, which is born from a proprietary nylon spandex poly blend fabric. Just like Lazyface sunscreen, this cap is easygoing, packable, and perfect for sun-soaked days. </span></p>", "published_at": "2026-10-07T17:54:43-04:00", "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:29:06-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00", "vendor": "Lazyface", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 50622682497081, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "48.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 10345421930553, "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:29:06-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 41619224494137, "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:28:07-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-10-01T18:28:11-04:00", "product_id": 10345421930553, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/ImageFrame_24.png?v=1790893691", "width": 1860, "height": 2478}, {"id": 41619224526905, "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:28:07-04:00", "position": 2, "updated_at": "2026-10-01T18:28:11-04:00", "product_id": 10345421930553, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/ImageFrame_25.png?v=1790893691", "width": 1860, "height": 2478}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 10345412952121, "title": "THE GOLF TOWEL", "handle": "the-golf-towel", "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span></span><span></span><span>Golf isn\u2019t a dirty sport, per se. But it\u2019s still played outside. \u2028So this outdoor brand (Lazyface) is tipping its cap (metaphorically) to the outdoor sport with the smallest balls (golf). Introducing the Lazyface Golf Towel, part of our capsule collection with Tremont Sporting Co. This reversible, two-color design always looks good wiping things off, no matter which side you\u2019re using. And the terrycloth blend is built to be highly absorbent and durable, for the days when it\u2019s really wet, you\u2019re really wet, or both. </span></p>", "published_at": "2026-10-07T17:54:25-04:00", "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:24:09-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00", "vendor": "Lazyface", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 50622659362873, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "48.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 10345412952121, "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:24:09-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 41619098599481, "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:21:19-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-10-01T18:21:25-04:00", "product_id": 10345412952121, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/ImageFrame_20.png?v=1790893285", "width": 1860, "height": 2478}, {"id": 41619098632249, "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:21:19-04:00", "position": 2, "updated_at": "2026-10-01T18:21:25-04:00", "product_id": 10345412952121, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/ImageFrame_21.png?v=1790893285", "width": 1860, "height": 2478}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 10345402466361, "title": "THE MALLET COVER", "handle": "the-mallet-cover", "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span></span><span></span><span>Blade putters punish mishits more than mallet putters. <br>So\u2014gun to our forehead\u2014we figured the truly lazy golfer would probably opt for a mallet. Hence, the Lazyface Mallet Cover\u2014part of our capsule collection with good folks at Tremont Sporting Co. This takes a good mallet cover and makes it good-er with an embroidered lazy sun that\u2019s stitched onto a pebbled, genuine cowhide exterior. This mallet cover is designed to make your playing partner say, \u201cRad!\u201d Or, \u201cCool!\u201d Or whatever your playing partner says when he\u2019s slightly jealous you got one before they sold out. </span></p>", "published_at": "2026-10-07T17:54:00-04:00", "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:17:58-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00", "vendor": "Lazyface", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 50622584619065, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "108.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 10345402466361, "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:17:58-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 41619003899961, "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:16:12-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-10-01T18:16:17-04:00", "product_id": 10345402466361, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/ImageFrame_16.png?v=1790892977", "width": 1860, "height": 2478}, {"id": 41619003932729, "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:16:12-04:00", "position": 2, "updated_at": "2026-10-01T18:16:17-04:00", "product_id": 10345402466361, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/ImageFrame_17.png?v=1790892977", "width": 1860, "height": 2478}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 10345387589689, "title": "THE WOOD COVER", "handle": "the-wood-cover", "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span></span><span></span><span>We love a good wood cover. That\u2019s why we partnered with the golf aficionados at Tremont Sporting Co. to create a capsule collection that\u2019s distinctly lazy, yet refined, yet lazy. Behold a premium, pebbled leather exterior with detailed stitch work! It fits all woods, including the 1-wood, otherwise known as a \u201cdriver.\u201d Whether you\u2019re playing the front nine or back nine, we got your wood covered with a luxurious, fleece liner. </span><br></p>", "published_at": "2026-10-07T17:53:41-04:00", "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:09:19-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00", "vendor": "Lazyface", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 50622494179385, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "118.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 10345387589689, "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:09:19-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 41618837209145, "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:08:11-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-10-01T18:08:16-04:00", "product_id": 10345387589689, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/ImageFrame_13.png?v=1790892496", "width": 1860, "height": 2478}, {"id": 41618842091577, "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:08:30-04:00", "position": 2, "updated_at": "2026-10-01T18:08:34-04:00", "product_id": 10345387589689, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/Image_Frame_14.png?v=1790892514", "width": 1860, "height": 2478}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 10345426944057, "title": "THE PENNANT", "handle": "the-pennant-1", "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span></span><span></span><span>Let your lazy flag fly. Or pin lazy onto your wall, instead. The Lazyface Pennant is built like a pennant from a byegone era\u2014classic felt construction with stitched edge detailing gives this wall ornament a vintage look that\u2019s also nice to touch. But don\u2019t! Because this pennant is part of the capsule collection with the golf atelier also known as Tremont Sporting Co. Your wall lusts for this. More than your wall has ever lusted after an expertly-stitched, strongly-crafted pennant flag ever before. </span></p>", "published_at": "2026-10-07T17:52:53-04:00", "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:32:37-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00", "vendor": "Lazyface", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 50622692163641, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "48.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 10345426944057, "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:32:37-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 41619271417913, "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:31:18-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-10-01T18:31:23-04:00", "product_id": 10345426944057, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/ImageFrame_27.png?v=1790893883", "width": 1860, "height": 2478}, {"id": 41619271450681, "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:31:18-04:00", "position": 2, "updated_at": "2026-10-01T18:31:23-04:00", "product_id": 10345426944057, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/ImageFrame_28.png?v=1790893883", "width": 1860, "height": 2478}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 8350711578681, "title": "THE FRANK TEE", "handle": "the-frank-tee", "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span></span><span></span><span>Frank is a frog. This is a brushed cotton tee-shirt. When two become one, Frank transforms from a regular, old tree frog into a totally chill, tee frog. Chill out softcore with Frank. He\u2019s got your back when he\u2019s on yours. </span></p>", "published_at": "2026-07-27T18:17:59-04:00", "created_at": "2026-07-20T17:38:22-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00", "vendor": "Lazyface", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 46227651723321, "title": "S", "option1": "S", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "45.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 8350711578681, "created_at": "2026-07-20T17:38:22-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00"}, {"id": 46227651756089, "title": "M", "option1": "M", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "45.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 2, "product_id": 8350711578681, "created_at": "2026-07-20T17:38:22-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00"}, {"id": 46227651788857, "title": "L", "option1": "L", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "45.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 3, "product_id": 8350711578681, "created_at": "2026-07-20T17:38:22-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00"}, {"id": 46227651821625, "title": "XL", "option1": "XL", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "45.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 4, "product_id": 8350711578681, "created_at": "2026-07-20T17:38:22-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00"}, {"id": 46227651854393, "title": "XXL", "option1": "XXL", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "45.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 5, "product_id": 8350711578681, "created_at": "2026-07-20T17:38:22-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 40254668046393, "created_at": "2026-07-20T17:54:02-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-07-20T17:54:04-04:00", "product_id": 8350711578681, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/ImageFrame_7.png?v=1784584444", "width": 1860, "height": 2478}, {"id": 40254668079161, "created_at": "2026-07-20T17:54:02-04:00", "position": 2, "updated_at": "2026-07-20T17:54:04-04:00", "product_id": 8350711578681, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/ImageFrame_4.png?v=1784584444", "width": 1860, "height": 2478}], "options": [{"name": "Size", "position": 1, "values": ["S", "M", "L", "XL", "XXL"]}]}, {"id": 8350711808057, "title": "THE RIVER CAP", "handle": "the-river-cap", "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span></span><span></span><span>This is a cap. It\u2019s nylon. And it\u2019s green. Did we mention it\u2019s green? And it\u2019s built from 100% quick dry nylon, making it lightweight AF? Green is a good color for summer. And lazy is a good vibe for you. So get your green, lazy vibe on with this nylon, summer-weight, mid-profile snapback.</span><br></p>", "published_at": "2026-07-27T18:17:26-04:00", "created_at": "2026-07-20T17:41:53-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00", "vendor": "Lazyface", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 46227652542521, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "50.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 8350711808057, "created_at": "2026-07-20T17:41:54-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 40254674632761, "created_at": "2026-07-20T17:56:31-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-07-20T17:56:33-04:00", "product_id": 8350711808057, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/ImageFrame_8.png?v=1784584593", "width": 1860, "height": 2478}, {"id": 40254674665529, "created_at": "2026-07-20T17:56:31-04:00", "position": 2, "updated_at": "2026-07-20T17:56:33-04:00", "product_id": 8350711808057, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/ImageFrame_9.png?v=1784584593", "width": 1860, "height": 2478}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 8350712660025, "title": "THE CAPTAIN CAP", "handle": "the-captain-cap", "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">Ahoy! There\u2019s a flotilla of hats coming into harbor and nothing screams semi-serious weekend boater like a rope strung across a flat bill. This eggshell, rope cap gives hardcore water vibes. And this 100% quick dry nylon gives hardcore dry vibes, too. Captain away, Captain! </span></p>", "published_at": "2026-07-27T18:17:02-04:00", "created_at": "2026-07-20T17:45:26-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00", "vendor": "Lazyface", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 46227657949241, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "45.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 8350712660025, "created_at": "2026-07-20T17:45:26-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 40254676303929, "created_at": "2026-07-20T17:57:37-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-07-20T17:57:39-04:00", "product_id": 8350712660025, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/ImageFrame_5.png?v=1784584659", "width": 1860, "height": 2478}, {"id": 40254676336697, "created_at": "2026-07-20T17:57:37-04:00", "position": 2, "updated_at": "2026-07-20T17:57:40-04:00", "product_id": 8350712660025, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/ImageFrame_6.png?v=1784584660", "width": 1860, "height": 2478}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 8350714167353, "title": "THE BUCKET", "handle": "the-bucket", "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span></span><span></span><span>Caddy Shack called. They\u2019d like to order six. This cap comes with 360 degree sun protection that simultaneously screams \u201csmart\u201d and \u201csuperiorly indifferent.\u201d It\u2019s made from light midweight cotton 100% cotton (whatever that means) with a UPF 50+ rating, to boot. Attack that lazy river like a professional river floater with a look that says, \u201cI couldn\u2019t care less.\u201d</span><br></p>", "published_at": "2026-07-27T18:16:29-04:00", "created_at": "2026-07-20T17:47:52-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00", "vendor": "Lazyface", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 46227660537913, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "60.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 8350714167353, "created_at": "2026-07-20T17:47:52-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 40254662606905, "created_at": "2026-07-20T17:50:29-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-07-20T17:50:31-04:00", "product_id": 8350714167353, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/ImageFrame.png?v=1784584231", "width": 1860, "height": 2478}, {"id": 40254663032889, "created_at": "2026-07-20T17:51:12-04:00", "position": 2, "updated_at": "2026-07-20T17:51:14-04:00", "product_id": 8350714167353, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/Image_Frame_1.png?v=1784584274", "width": 1860, "height": 2478}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 8213527855161, "title": "THE FACE SET", "handle": "the-face-set", "body_html": "<div class=\"product__description rte quick-add-hidden\">\n<div class=\"product__description__content rte\">\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span></span><span></span><span>After three years of tinkering, Dr. Steven Kent cracked the sunscreen code (mineral-based, streak-free, no-whitecast). It feels light on the skin but it\u2019s heavy on sun protection. We humbly think it\u2019s really, really good stuff. Inside a really, really green squeezable bottle and a handsome little tube. Put another way, it\u2019s what the skin doctor ordered. Or designed. By himself. For your lazy old face. </span></p>\n</div>\n</div>", "published_at": "2026-03-27T16:07:32-04:00", "created_at": "2026-03-22T22:09:00-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00", "vendor": "Lazyface", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 45622093316153, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "54.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 8213527855161, "created_at": "2026-03-22T22:09:01-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 38915537829945, "created_at": "2026-03-22T22:10:22-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-03-22T22:10:23-04:00", "product_id": 8213527855161, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/Faceset-1_1.jpg?v=1774231823", "width": 1240, "height": 1652}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 7777050558521, "title": "FACESCREEN", "handle": "facescreen", "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span></span><span></span><span>Our founder, Dr. Steven Kent, was seeing too many guys from his five-to-nine in his nine-to-five. So he created a sunscreen he\u2019d recommend to any clinical patient (mineral-based, streak-free, no-whitecast) but priced for drug store customers, not fancypants department store shoppers. Think of it as a one-step, idiot-friendly whole-of-face suncare routine for dummies. Or bikers, golfers, hikers, and boaters. </span><br></p>", "published_at": "2026-03-27T14:21:24-04:00", "created_at": "2024-11-21T12:29:01-05:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00", "vendor": "Lazyface", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 45643161370681, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": "LZF-MIN30-FG-1", "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "35.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 7777050558521, "created_at": "2026-03-27T14:20:12-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 38819804610617, "created_at": "2026-03-10T21:02:45-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-03-10T21:02:46-04:00", "product_id": 7777050558521, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/Facescreen-1.jpg?v=1773190966", "width": 1240, "height": 1652}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 8203810373689, "title": "THE KOOZIE", "handle": "the-koozie", "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span></span><span></span><span>Cans are sensitive to sun (and heat) too. So protect your beverage of choice from sunshine, sweltering days, hot hands, sweaty palms, UVA, UVB, and skunky notes. </span></p>", "published_at": "2026-03-11T17:26:07-04:00", "created_at": "2026-03-10T19:38:32-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00", "vendor": "Lazyface", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 45580709036089, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "10.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 8203810373689, "created_at": "2026-03-10T19:38:32-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 38819580117049, "created_at": "2026-03-10T19:38:03-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-03-10T19:38:05-04:00", "product_id": 8203810373689, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/Koozie-1.jpg?v=1773185885", "width": 1240, "height": 1652}, {"id": 38819580149817, "created_at": "2026-03-10T19:38:03-04:00", "position": 2, "updated_at": "2026-03-10T19:38:04-04:00", "product_id": 8203810373689, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/Koozie-2.jpg?v=1773185884", "width": 1240, "height": 1652}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 8203810144313, "title": "THE TWO-TONE CAP", "handle": "the-two-tone-cap", "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span></span><span></span><span>What\u2019s there to say about a two-tone ball cap? Keeps the sun out of your eyes? Check. Protects your noggin? Check. Comes in two colors? Check and check. </span></p>", "published_at": "2026-03-11T17:25:32-04:00", "created_at": "2026-03-10T19:37:05-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00", "vendor": "Lazyface", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 45580702613561, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "35.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 8203810144313, "created_at": "2026-03-10T19:37:06-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 38819578052665, "created_at": "2026-03-10T19:36:55-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-03-10T19:36:57-04:00", "product_id": 8203810144313, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/Two-Tone-Cap-1.jpg?v=1773185817", "width": 1240, "height": 1652}, {"id": 38819578085433, "created_at": "2026-03-10T19:36:55-04:00", "position": 2, "updated_at": "2026-03-10T19:36:57-04:00", "product_id": 8203810144313, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/Two-Tone-Cap-2.jpg?v=1773185817", "width": 1240, "height": 1652}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 8203809914937, "title": "THE BALL CAP", "handle": "the-ball-cap", "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span></span><span></span><span>What\u2019s your ball of choice? Golf? Volley? Spike? Pool Basket? Whatever ball is your jam, this cap is purpose built to help you ball out. And if your thing is doing less, this cap can help keep the sun out of your eyes while you chill out, too. </span></p>", "published_at": "2026-03-11T17:24:52-04:00", "created_at": "2026-03-10T19:35:16-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00", "vendor": "Lazyface", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 45580702351417, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "35.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 8203809914937, "created_at": "2026-03-10T19:35:17-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 38819573792825, "created_at": "2026-03-10T19:34:57-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2026-03-10T19:34:58-04:00", "product_id": 8203809914937, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/Ball-Cap-1.png?v=1773185698", "width": 620, "height": 826}, {"id": 38819573825593, "created_at": "2026-03-10T19:34:57-04:00", "position": 2, "updated_at": "2026-03-10T19:34:58-04:00", "product_id": 8203809914937, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0696/1981/0361/files/Ball-Cap-2.png?v=1773185698", "width": 620, "height": 826}], "options": [{"name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}]}, {"id": 8203809751097, "title": "THE SUN CAP", "handle": "the-sun-cap", "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span></span><span></span><span>Perfect for temperate climates in the summer or subtropical climates in the winter, this corduroy cap keeps your head cozy and the sun out of your eyes. </span></p>", "published_at": "2026-03-11T17:24:38-04:00", "created_at": "2026-03-10T19:31:34-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00", "vendor": "Lazyface", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 45580701302841, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "35.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 8203809751097, "created_at": "2026-03-10T19:31:34-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-17T22:30:16-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 38819561996345, "c